WEBVTT

00:06.600 --> 00:07.600
Coming!

00:08.720 --> 00:10.960
Okay! Okay! Here I...

00:11.380 --> 00:12.380
am?

00:14.860 --> 00:15.969
What?

00:15.970 --> 00:18.240
It rang, didn't it?

00:15.970 --> 00:18.239
Segawa Yuuta

00:18.240 --> 00:19.790
Huh?

00:18.241 --> 00:20.225
AAAA
AAAA
AAAA

00:20.226 --> 00:24.480
Takanashi

00:21.740 --> 00:23.129
Who is it?

00:23.130 --> 00:24.479
Oh, good morning!

00:24.480 --> 00:24.520
- AAAA AAAA AAAA
- Takanashi

00:24.480 --> 00:24.518
Segawa Yuuta

00:24.731 --> 00:24.770
- AAAA AAAA AAAA
- Segawa Yuuta

00:24.800 --> 00:26.800
Sorry, there was no one there.

00:26.801 --> 00:29.469
Shoot! I didn't think
it would actually ring!

00:29.470 --> 00:33.230
You and your antics made it malfunction.

00:33.760 --> 00:35.019
It'll be fine!

00:35.020 --> 00:36.120
We can't!

00:39.900 --> 00:41.759
My heart almost stopped!

00:41.760 --> 00:44.780
That's stupid, especially
since it's no longer beating.

00:47.090 --> 00:51.059
At least we're able to crack jokes.

00:51.060 --> 00:53.969
It's been four years since that day.

00:53.970 --> 00:56.329
Did Sora sound more mature to you?

00:56.330 --> 00:57.330
Yeah.

00:57.331 --> 00:59.549
I wonder how Miu and Hina turned out.

00:59.550 --> 01:00.430
- AAAA AAAA
- Takanashi Sora, Miu, Hina Segawa Yuuta

01:00.433 --> 01:02.540
I bet they've really changed!

01:03.310 --> 01:06.260
What if they changed for the
worse? I'm too scared to look!

01:06.260 --> 01:07.560
Let's go back!

01:08.450 --> 01:10.600
Will you relax, stupid husband?!

01:11.730 --> 01:13.789
This is our only chance, remember?

01:13.790 --> 01:17.899
And they only gave us
one day to do it, so focus.

01:16.381 --> 01:21.320
Takanashi
Sora, Miu, Hina
Segawa Yuuta

01:17.900 --> 01:20.750
Yeah... I should.

01:22.000 --> 01:23.649
Let's go, shall we?

01:23.650 --> 01:24.440
Yes.

01:26.456 --> 01:28.460
Takanashi
Sora, Miu, Hina
Segawa Yuuta

01:28.850 --> 01:35.840
A SPRING WITH SPECIAL VISITORS

01:29.050 --> 01:30.959
Beat these eggs, Onii-chan!

01:30.960 --> 01:31.760
Got it!

01:31.761 --> 01:34.079
Hina, why don't we make soup?

01:34.080 --> 01:34.740
Yeah!

01:34.741 --> 01:38.110
Can we have pumpkin soup
this morning, Sora-oneechan?

01:38.111 --> 01:41.139
Hina's... Hina's talking so clearly!

01:41.140 --> 01:43.009
Don't cry, honey.

01:43.010 --> 01:45.849
I can't go in, or else
I'll burst into tears.

01:45.850 --> 01:49.139
But here you are crying already.

01:49.140 --> 01:50.140
Come on, let's go.

01:50.360 --> 01:51.360
Sure.

01:53.860 --> 01:56.600
TAKANASHI SORA
18 YEARS OLD – HIGH SCHOOL SENIOR

01:56.280 --> 01:57.859
Be careful! It's hot!

01:56.601 --> 01:57.860
Our girls are so big.

01:57.860 --> 01:59.020
Yeah.

01:59.021 --> 02:00.860
- SEGAWA YUUTA 23 YEARS OLD – WORKING ADULT
- I need to remember how they look.

01:59.520 --> 02:00.000
Right.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.000
I'm fine.

02:01.430 --> 02:03.279
So Yuuta's working now?

02:03.280 --> 02:05.710
I feel like he's the older one.

02:04.210 --> 02:05.709
I'm putting it here.

02:05.710 --> 02:06.869
I can't agree more.

02:06.870 --> 02:09.120
TAKANASHI MIU
15 YEARS OLD – 9TH GRADER

02:07.210 --> 02:09.119
What would you like, Hina?

02:09.120 --> 02:11.290
Margarine and chocolate cream!

02:09.120 --> 02:11.289
TAKANASHI HINA
8 YEARS OLD – 2ND GRADER

02:11.290 --> 02:12.290
Roger that!

02:12.420 --> 02:16.799
Wait. Didn't I use to
spread it like that for them?

02:16.800 --> 02:18.300
Exactly half and half.

02:18.980 --> 02:21.430
She gets that preciseness from you.

02:22.080 --> 02:26.190
And Hina's mixing it exactly
the way you taught Sora.

02:26.720 --> 02:29.829
I wasn't even too fussy about it either.

02:29.830 --> 02:31.049
All done!

02:31.050 --> 02:33.190
Good, let's eat!

02:33.500 --> 02:35.190
Thanks for the food!

02:38.760 --> 02:41.850
She's blowing on it and
drinking it all by herself!

02:44.050 --> 02:46.200
Sora's omelettes are nice and fluffy.

02:46.490 --> 02:48.699
Yeah, they sure are.

02:48.700 --> 02:51.839
Ah, would you like canned
peaches for dessert?

02:51.840 --> 02:53.899
But we have some kiwis, remember?

02:53.900 --> 02:55.710
You can put those in yogurt.

02:56.180 --> 03:00.119
It'll give you a perfect balance
of calcium and vitamin B1.

03:00.120 --> 03:02.219
I see. Let's go with that.

03:02.220 --> 03:05.299
Wow, Miu-chan. You're an expert.

03:05.300 --> 03:07.219
I want to give you peace of mind,

03:07.220 --> 03:10.219
since I want to live alone
once I get into high school.

03:10.220 --> 03:11.950
- Living alone?!
- Living alone?!

03:11.953 --> 03:14.210
- No way! I won't allow it!
- No way! I won't allow it!

03:17.010 --> 03:18.400
You two were totally in sync.

03:18.750 --> 03:20.350
You got me there.

03:20.780 --> 03:22.865
How many times do I have to tell you?

03:22.866 --> 03:26.110
It looks like Yuuta-kun has
become a real father to them.

03:23.550 --> 03:26.109
Living alone is not an easy feat!

03:26.110 --> 03:28.280
You have to take care
of everything yourself!

03:26.400 --> 03:28.279
Yeah, what an ego.

03:28.280 --> 03:31.790
Miu's has also learned
to speak up for herself.

03:28.910 --> 03:30.630
Fine.

03:32.210 --> 03:35.210
It's amazing how time flies.

03:32.540 --> 03:34.089
Are you listening to me?

03:34.090 --> 03:36.270
It's simply too risky!

03:37.470 --> 03:38.789
After finishing breakfast,

03:38.790 --> 03:43.139
I remember always sitting
here doing Hina's hair.

03:43.140 --> 03:44.550
I'm done!

03:49.970 --> 03:52.080
Do my hair! Do my hair!

03:55.460 --> 03:57.309
Miu-oneechan, hurry!

03:57.310 --> 04:00.190
Yeah, yeah, I'm coming!

04:04.020 --> 04:07.099
Guess what? When I come home from school,

04:07.100 --> 04:10.079
me and Eri-chan are going to
Koyagiya to buy some treats.

04:10.080 --> 04:11.780
What should I get?

04:12.430 --> 04:13.420
Coronets?

04:13.421 --> 04:15.500
Hina, are your ears itching?

04:15.990 --> 04:17.500
Should I clean them for you?

04:18.810 --> 04:20.629
No, they don't itch at all.

04:20.630 --> 04:22.299
Okay, all done.

04:22.300 --> 04:24.260
Thank you, Miu-oneechan!

04:24.630 --> 04:26.260
Okay, I'm leaving!

04:31.650 --> 04:36.270
Be careful Uncle, Miu-oneechan,
and Sora-oneechan!

04:36.570 --> 04:38.280
I'll see you!

04:39.220 --> 04:40.909
D-Did you see that?

04:40.910 --> 04:42.059
Did you?

04:42.060 --> 04:43.599
Hina put on a backpack!

04:43.600 --> 04:45.789
I saw it! I definitely saw it!

04:45.790 --> 04:47.780
It was so cute!

04:48.530 --> 04:51.079
Okay, be careful out there.

04:51.080 --> 04:52.859
Sure, you too, Onii-chan.

04:52.860 --> 04:54.450
Bye!

05:00.460 --> 05:02.019
And off they go.

05:02.020 --> 05:03.020
Yeah.

05:04.500 --> 05:08.189
Wow, Sora's room was always so plain.

05:08.190 --> 05:10.650
It has to be since she's
studying for entrance exams.

05:11.220 --> 05:13.220
- - MEMORIZING CLASSICAL
VOCABULARY THROUGH MNEMONICS

05:11.220 --> 05:13.220
- TEST CENTER POLITICAL SCIENCE, ECONOMICS, AND LOGICS - TEST CENTER
ENGLISH (PRONUNCIATION, ACCENTS, EXPRESSIONS, CONVERSATIONS, AND LISTENING)

05:11.220 --> 05:13.220
- NATIONAL UNIVERSITIES (THE FIRST YEAR) ISSUES & SOLUTIONS -
NATIONAL UNIVERSITIES (POLITICAL SCIENCE/ECONOMICS) ISSUES & SOLUTIONS

05:11.220 --> 05:13.220
- NATIONAL UNIVERSITIES
(SCIENCES) ISSUES & SOLUTIONS -

05:11.490 --> 05:13.219
Which college is she aiming for?

05:13.220 --> 05:17.249
From the looks of it, she may
have been accepted somewhere.

05:17.250 --> 05:18.440
You think?

05:19.430 --> 05:20.430
What is it?!

05:20.910 --> 05:23.140
These bras! They're C cups!

05:24.010 --> 05:27.280
As her father, I'm not sure how to react.

05:28.130 --> 05:30.269
Does she have a boyfriend?

05:30.270 --> 05:34.169
There was supposed to be a
classmate that had feelings for her...

05:34.170 --> 05:35.290
She's too young!

05:36.850 --> 05:38.230
She doesn't need a man!

05:41.130 --> 05:43.750
I see Miu's into high fashion.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.750
But not one reference book.

05:47.190 --> 05:48.190
Look at these.

05:50.010 --> 05:52.009
Wow, Miu.

05:52.010 --> 05:55.010
Design Study Notes

05:52.390 --> 05:55.010
Guess you've already decided
what you're going to be.

05:57.830 --> 05:58.979
Sasha?

05:58.980 --> 06:01.419
It looks like they've become really close.

06:01.420 --> 06:02.980
Not sure how I feel about that.

06:03.720 --> 06:07.620
But she certainly has her
mother's determination.

06:08.190 --> 06:08.240
- DREAM
- TAKANASHI HINA

06:08.700 --> 06:09.989
Look at this!

06:09.990 --> 06:13.260
It's like we're witnessing
four years worth of Hina!

06:13.261 --> 06:15.990
- 50th annual entrance ceremony - Here she
must be crying after stumbling in a footrace.

06:16.490 --> 06:17.990
That's so cute!

06:18.390 --> 06:21.759
They're all so cute! I want to kiss them!

06:21.760 --> 06:22.950
Okay, okay.

06:23.880 --> 06:26.000
This essay got five stars?

06:27.360 --> 06:28.510
What've we got here?

06:28.850 --> 06:32.319
"I don't have a mother or a father."

06:32.320 --> 06:37.589
"But since I have my uncle and my
two sisters, I'm having fun every day."

06:37.590 --> 06:40.789
"My uncle always makes me laugh."

06:40.790 --> 06:46.729
"Sometimes he gets mad, but he teaches me
a lot of things, and I love him very much."

06:46.730 --> 06:52.130
"When I grow up, I want to
marry someone like my uncle."

06:52.400 --> 06:54.899
I know it's early, but should we head back?

06:54.900 --> 06:55.900
Yeah.

06:56.710 --> 07:00.180
But does Hina have a fever?

07:02.500 --> 07:04.320
Hey, let's go see her.

07:05.310 --> 07:06.880
Let's visit her class.

07:07.520 --> 07:09.000
We still haven't seen hers yet.

07:10.880 --> 07:13.059
So I guess this is gym class.

07:13.060 --> 07:14.709
Sure looks like it.

07:14.710 --> 07:16.720
I remember those vaulting horses.

07:17.160 --> 07:21.519
I'm glad we came to see
Hina in her gym clothes.

07:21.520 --> 07:23.919
I swear, she's the cutest kid in class.

07:23.920 --> 07:26.419
You get so crazy over her.

07:26.420 --> 07:28.179
Are we really watching from here?

07:28.180 --> 07:31.439
I thought it'd give us a better experience.

07:31.440 --> 07:33.709
No, this is too much.

07:33.710 --> 07:35.969
Just like you did last time,

07:35.970 --> 07:40.359
first you jump as high as you
can, then straddle the horse.

07:40.360 --> 07:42.689
If you can jump over the
horse, you certainly may.

07:42.690 --> 07:43.790
Okay!

07:44.090 --> 07:45.790
Oh, here they come!

07:55.650 --> 07:56.990
Hina's next.

08:00.730 --> 08:02.060
You can do it, Hina!

08:06.230 --> 08:08.230
Hina!

08:12.070 --> 08:13.470
Huh...?

08:14.200 --> 08:16.200
You all right, Takanashi-san?

08:18.080 --> 08:20.600
Wow! That's awesome, Hina!

08:46.900 --> 08:47.989
Bye-bye!

08:47.990 --> 08:48.480
Bye!

08:48.480 --> 08:49.480
See you!

08:49.990 --> 08:51.959
Do you know what you're getting?

08:51.960 --> 08:54.199
It was so great seeing Hina.

08:54.200 --> 08:56.110
It's one perk of being a ghost.

08:56.500 --> 08:58.110
All right, we're moving on!

09:03.440 --> 09:05.829
Takanashi-senpai's starting her rehearsal!

09:05.830 --> 09:06.260
Really?

09:06.260 --> 09:06.880
I'm there!

09:06.881 --> 09:08.120
Where?!

09:07.430 --> 09:08.430
Wait!

09:10.270 --> 09:12.630
Whoa, what is this?

09:13.340 --> 09:16.589
My hear throbs when I see a bright sunset

09:16.590 --> 09:19.969
my favorite ribbon or swirling milk tea

09:19.970 --> 09:26.599
My notebook is dotted
with those shiny little things

09:26.600 --> 09:29.979
Ever since I met you,
you've brightened my world

09:29.980 --> 09:31.909
But I still feel that something is missing

09:31.910 --> 09:33.479
Is this real?

09:33.480 --> 09:38.190
I want you to protect me always

09:33.490 --> 09:36.650
It sure is. Even her teachers are here.

09:38.780 --> 09:39.859
Let's go!

09:39.860 --> 09:42.949
HAPPY HAPPY GIRL! HAPPY HAPPY GIRL!

09:42.950 --> 09:46.289
Let me believe in our future

09:46.290 --> 09:53.000
I want us to show each
other how happy we can be

09:46.290 --> 09:48.189
She may even become an idol.

09:48.190 --> 09:53.000
I don't trust the entertainment
industry, but it could happen.

09:59.540 --> 10:02.859
Okay, this ends rehearsals for today.

10:02.860 --> 10:05.510
Be sure to practice at home.

10:05.850 --> 10:08.640
Good night!

10:10.180 --> 10:11.649
Takanashi-senpai!

10:11.650 --> 10:15.039
How was I? Did I direct them well?

10:15.040 --> 10:18.360
Yes. You were very easy to understand.

10:18.750 --> 10:22.630
I was right in making you
the next president, Tomorin.

10:23.950 --> 10:25.779
Thank you very much!

10:25.780 --> 10:27.110
There's just one thing.

10:28.110 --> 10:33.580
The part when the sopranos sing the second
extended "re" in the second song's hook.

10:33.880 --> 10:37.159
It tends to waver a bit, so you
should warn them about that.

10:37.160 --> 10:39.590
Okay, thank you very much!

10:39.960 --> 10:43.559
Wow, look at her go!

10:43.560 --> 10:45.840
So she's the former club president.

10:46.480 --> 10:50.100
To think that the overly bashful Sora
we once knew is now this poised...

10:59.280 --> 11:00.609
Takanashi!

11:00.610 --> 11:01.820
Yes?

11:04.080 --> 11:06.139
So... um!

11:06.140 --> 11:07.369
I, uh...

11:07.370 --> 11:10.669
Who is he and why is he fidgeting?

11:10.670 --> 11:13.299
Um, I'm saying this because
we're about to graduate.

11:13.300 --> 11:15.939
But I've always been watching you...

11:15.940 --> 11:19.549
Since you're so cute...
and such a nice person.

11:19.550 --> 11:21.859
Oh my, is he confessing?

11:21.860 --> 11:24.790
We can even start off as friends.
Please go out with me!

11:25.470 --> 11:26.559
You're too young!

11:26.560 --> 11:29.429
You're not ready for
this, so shoot him down!

11:29.430 --> 11:32.299
Shoot him down, Sora! Shoot him down, Sora!

11:32.300 --> 11:33.240
I'm sorry!

11:33.241 --> 11:35.599
Yes, good girl. Way to go.

11:35.600 --> 11:38.990
I, uh, already like someone else.

11:40.320 --> 11:41.709
You do?

11:41.710 --> 11:43.889
Then that's that, I guess.

11:43.890 --> 11:46.270
Sorry. Thanks for hearing me out!

11:46.280 --> 11:50.959
Wh... Who does she like? Her dead father?

11:50.960 --> 11:52.040
Don't be stupid.

11:53.010 --> 11:55.830
I couldn't tell him that
I'm going to get married.

11:58.720 --> 12:01.839
Sora... did she really say
she's getting married?

12:01.840 --> 12:03.990
What is the meaning of that?

12:04.500 --> 12:07.140
It means we can't go back just yet.

12:11.740 --> 12:13.350
Whose shoes are those?

12:24.180 --> 12:25.860
<i>Bylo khorosho!</i>

12:27.950 --> 12:29.649
That's Sasha!

12:29.650 --> 12:32.119
This is something out of a love triangle!

12:32.120 --> 12:35.869
Dammit! She <i>does</i> have bigger boobs than me!

12:35.870 --> 12:38.119
What? <i>That's</i> your issue?

12:38.120 --> 12:43.129
Yuuta? <i>Spasibo</i> for the bath. It felt great!

12:43.130 --> 12:46.269
The bathroom in my
<i>Yaponiya</i> apartment is so small,

12:46.270 --> 12:48.130
so it's been a while
since I soaked in a tub.

12:48.520 --> 12:53.320
I left the new design for Sora's dress in the
living room, so be sure to look at it later.

12:59.530 --> 13:02.260
You're kidding, right? Is this for real?

13:02.770 --> 13:05.010
Wait. What does that say?

13:05.800 --> 13:09.290
It says this dress is for
Yuuta and Sora's wedding.

13:14.110 --> 13:17.190
Yuuta... and I thought you
liked well endowed women!

13:17.700 --> 13:19.540
What about that cat-eared girl?

13:22.630 --> 13:24.390
Meow...

13:24.840 --> 13:27.859
Forget about that!
She's not ready for this!

13:27.860 --> 13:29.729
What is going on here?!

13:29.730 --> 13:33.949
This is not what I wanted when I
let Yuuta-kun take care of them!

13:33.950 --> 13:35.409
Oh, god...

13:35.410 --> 13:38.109
Oh god, what if this is some
kind of shotgun wedding...?

13:38.110 --> 13:40.399
Calm down! Relax!

13:40.400 --> 13:42.899
Slow down and think this through.

13:42.900 --> 13:48.110
I don't think those kids would get
married over something that... careless.

13:51.250 --> 13:52.350
Yeah.

13:58.120 --> 13:59.420
Man...

14:02.220 --> 14:03.569
What is it?

14:03.570 --> 14:06.690
I've just read Sora's diary.

14:07.880 --> 14:09.409
You can't do that!

14:09.410 --> 14:10.739
Right.

14:10.740 --> 14:12.970
So, what did she write?

14:13.820 --> 14:16.790
Those two were awkward as
hell, but they were earnest.

14:17.510 --> 14:20.729
They went through all sorts of
hoops before deciding to marry.

14:20.730 --> 14:24.390
But they reached that decision
with the love and support of everyone.

14:28.210 --> 14:29.470
I see.

14:31.800 --> 14:32.800
Daddy.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.740
Wanna take a bath?

14:40.990 --> 14:43.609
This takes me back.

14:43.610 --> 14:48.069
We always used to make
up in here after a fight.

14:48.070 --> 14:50.030
Not that we had any arguments today...

14:51.540 --> 14:53.760
So have you cleared your thoughts?

14:54.800 --> 14:55.859
Maybe.

14:55.860 --> 14:57.330
Maybe?

14:58.450 --> 14:59.990
But I don't blame you.

15:02.430 --> 15:05.129
That reminds me, is Hina okay?

15:05.130 --> 15:06.470
You mean this?

15:07.610 --> 15:09.779
Whenever Hina does that...

15:09.780 --> 15:12.400
it means she has a fever!

15:13.220 --> 15:15.689
But that was when she was younger.

15:15.690 --> 15:17.990
She should be fine... right?

15:18.720 --> 15:19.720
Yeah...

15:22.840 --> 15:24.039
I'm back!

15:24.040 --> 15:27.559
If only your bust size was a little bigger.

15:27.560 --> 15:29.659
Then we could accentuate this area.

15:29.660 --> 15:30.989
What the heck?!

15:30.990 --> 15:32.769
We don't need to "accentuate" anything!

15:32.770 --> 15:33.799
Hey!

15:33.800 --> 15:38.050
You and Uncle are going to
kiss during your wedding, right?

15:38.820 --> 15:40.589
Hina! Where'd that come from?!

15:40.590 --> 15:42.659
Where did you pick that up?!

15:42.660 --> 15:44.879
Everybody knows about that!

15:44.880 --> 15:48.239
How does it feel when you
kiss? Like you're floating?

15:48.240 --> 15:51.359
Oh, I'd like to know too!

15:51.360 --> 15:52.859
So tell us, how is it like?

15:52.860 --> 15:54.789
I-I don't know yet!

15:54.790 --> 15:57.850
No, she doesn't, so don't ask her!

15:58.320 --> 15:59.890
Did you say "yet"?

16:00.910 --> 16:02.409
You two still haven't done it?

16:02.410 --> 16:05.419
Get out! Is that even
possible in this day and age?!

16:05.420 --> 16:06.829
Wh-Why do you care?!

16:06.830 --> 16:07.660
Mommy.

16:07.661 --> 16:11.549
Y-Yeah! You don't
have to rush these things!

16:11.550 --> 16:13.839
Do it now!

16:13.840 --> 16:15.130
Kiss!

16:16.930 --> 16:18.140
Feeling relieved?

16:19.640 --> 16:21.640
That they never kissed?

16:22.060 --> 16:23.440
Should I?

16:24.060 --> 16:26.340
I for one want to kick Yuuta's behind.

16:27.020 --> 16:29.329
Love comes in all shapes and sizes.

16:29.330 --> 16:32.339
I suppose this is what's best for Sora.

16:32.340 --> 16:34.449
So you <i>are</i> relieved.

16:34.450 --> 16:37.570
Whatever the case,
there's no stopping them.

16:41.440 --> 16:42.440
Hina?

16:50.400 --> 16:51.400
Hina?

16:52.060 --> 16:53.050
I knew it.

16:53.051 --> 16:54.920
She's sweating buckets.

16:55.400 --> 16:57.030
Poor thing.

17:01.160 --> 17:04.360
I'm sorry, Hina, but I can't hold you.

17:06.830 --> 17:08.469
No, it can't happen!

17:08.470 --> 17:11.170
They can't get married if
they don't notice things like this!

17:20.200 --> 17:22.219
It looks like she <i>does</i> have a fever.

17:22.220 --> 17:23.370
Look at that sweat.

17:24.060 --> 17:26.639
She's been fiddling with that ear all day.

17:26.640 --> 17:28.030
Good thing I bought these.

17:29.620 --> 17:31.380
Hina, are you all right?

17:31.660 --> 17:34.670
Let's wipe off that sweat and
get you in some new clothes.

17:32.180 --> 17:33.329
Sora...

17:33.330 --> 17:34.669
Yuuta...

17:34.670 --> 17:37.460
Onee-chan... Oi-tan...

17:38.780 --> 17:40.890
I saw Mommy and Daddy.

17:42.260 --> 17:43.550
You had a dream?

17:44.530 --> 17:47.129
Mommy was holding me.

17:47.130 --> 17:49.509
Really? That's nice.

17:49.510 --> 17:51.560
Yeah, it was nice.

17:51.860 --> 17:55.290
Come on, let's get you
into some new pajamas.

17:57.140 --> 17:58.900
But before that, here.

18:00.240 --> 18:01.840
This feels great.

18:10.230 --> 18:12.459
I'll look after her while you sleep.

18:12.460 --> 18:16.340
I'm fine. You, on the other
hand, have to get up early.

18:17.280 --> 18:20.729
Okay, let's both watch her
for a little while longer.

18:20.730 --> 18:21.730
Yeah.

18:30.310 --> 18:32.619
I think it's about time.

18:32.620 --> 18:34.099
I think so too.

18:34.100 --> 18:36.509
Though I really don't want to go.

18:36.510 --> 18:38.969
Why are you saying that?

18:38.970 --> 18:40.280
Sorry.

18:40.800 --> 18:43.020
Nah, I feel the same way.

18:52.780 --> 18:54.789
It's just the way we left it.

18:54.790 --> 18:57.800
It's like time has
stopped for this one room.

18:59.770 --> 19:02.040
I wish it could stop forever.

19:08.660 --> 19:09.720
Are you ready?

19:10.320 --> 19:12.810
I'm not sure, but come anyway.

19:13.600 --> 19:15.310
I can't believe you found that.

19:16.130 --> 19:19.360
I'm sorry, for keeping you up for this.

19:26.720 --> 19:29.099
I've been thinking a lot about this.

19:29.100 --> 19:34.809
It's so sad how we can't give thanks
to my dad or Yuri-san at our wedding.

19:34.810 --> 19:36.829
I've been thinking about that too.

19:36.830 --> 19:41.089
I'm not sure why, but I want to do it now.

19:41.090 --> 19:44.249
Was that... what I used to cosplay in?

19:44.250 --> 19:47.919
Then that means she saw even
more of my embarrassing outfits!

19:47.920 --> 19:49.319
What do you mean?

19:49.320 --> 19:50.320
Look...

19:53.600 --> 19:57.510
Hina may be dreaming about us right now.

19:58.440 --> 20:01.750
That means Nee-san and
Shingo-san are right here with us.

20:03.750 --> 20:04.750
Shall we?

20:08.580 --> 20:09.619
Nee-san...

20:09.620 --> 20:10.979
Shingo-san...

20:10.980 --> 20:13.590
We have decided to marry each other.

20:14.480 --> 20:17.069
We're not sure if it will all go well,

20:17.070 --> 20:19.579
but we know we will do our best,

20:19.580 --> 20:21.630
so I hope you two will
always watch over us.

20:22.280 --> 20:23.340
You got it.

20:23.840 --> 20:25.900
You never got to hear me say this,

20:26.450 --> 20:28.110
but I'll say it now:

20:29.680 --> 20:34.069
I thank you so much for
raising me when I was little.

20:34.070 --> 20:36.440
You're the best sister anyone can have!

20:38.480 --> 20:39.779
Dummy.

20:39.780 --> 20:43.650
You know I can't hug
you after hearing that.

20:45.060 --> 20:46.319
Dad,

20:46.320 --> 20:51.109
ever since I was little, you
were always there with a smile.

20:51.110 --> 20:54.159
You got furious whenever
I did something dangerous,

20:54.160 --> 20:58.379
but you would give me a smile
and a hug after I apologized.

20:58.380 --> 21:01.399
Whenever I got depressed over a mishap,

21:01.400 --> 21:05.009
no matter the reason, you always
smiled and said I'll be just fine,

21:05.010 --> 21:07.659
which cheered me up right away.

21:07.660 --> 21:13.450
But when I got into fifth grade, I started to hate
getting hugs from you, and for that I'm sorry.

21:13.980 --> 21:17.690
Back then, I never thought
I would lose you so soon.

21:18.450 --> 21:24.689
I wanted to buy you presents with my
own money as an adult, take you on trips...

21:24.690 --> 21:29.530
massage your shoulders,
share some wine with you...

21:30.440 --> 21:32.669
There's so much I wanted to do for you.

21:32.670 --> 21:35.569
I'm so sorry we can't have those moments.

21:35.570 --> 21:36.570
But...

21:36.950 --> 21:41.049
I still keep your smiles inside of me.

21:41.050 --> 21:44.140
So I'll never give up,
no matter the obstacles.

21:44.960 --> 21:49.010
Now that I've grown up, please
keep watching over me.

21:49.550 --> 21:51.880
Dad, I love you.

21:52.510 --> 21:55.470
I can never, ever thank you enough.

21:56.700 --> 21:57.730
Sora-chan...

21:59.050 --> 22:00.559
Yuuta-kun...

22:00.560 --> 22:02.860
Take care of Sora for me.

22:03.810 --> 22:04.820
Sora...

22:05.370 --> 22:08.949
Say whatever's on your mind,
and clash if you have to.

22:08.950 --> 22:10.740
But always stay close.

22:30.970 --> 22:32.159
Nee-san?

22:32.160 --> 22:33.260
Dad?

22:34.120 --> 22:37.040
I think... they were hugging us.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.110
Me too.

22:52.490 --> 22:54.170
Were they really here?

22:54.171 --> 22:56.240
Happy Happy Girl! Happy Happy Girl!

22:56.241 --> 22:57.430
Yeah. I know they were.

22:57.431 --> 23:00.450
I wonder when it all happened?

23:00.450 --> 23:06.960
My chest is filled with
bits and pieces of you.

23:13.830 --> 23:17.259
What will I do? Now I'm
imagining us on a date.

23:17.260 --> 23:20.219
My heart is about to leap out.

23:20.220 --> 23:23.679
But even if I try to hide my embarrassment,

23:23.680 --> 23:25.939
I already know.

23:25.940 --> 23:33.940
My heart and thoughts
are directed towards you,

23:36.750 --> 23:40.200
I have fallen in love.

23:41.820 --> 23:45.229
Happy Happy Girl! Happy Happy Girl!

23:45.230 --> 23:48.369
Let me yell out.

23:48.370 --> 23:51.899
I want to embrace the same skies as you.

23:51.900 --> 23:54.999
Let's run and chase our dreams together.

23:55.000 --> 23:58.339
Candy Candy Love! Candy Candy Love!

23:58.340 --> 24:01.719
I might not know how to take the lead yet.

24:01.720 --> 24:08.179
But if I were to become
your pillar of support,

24:08.180 --> 24:11.730
can I keep on secretly loving you?

24:23.670 --> 24:27.659
My sweet love sparkles bright.

24:27.660 --> 24:31.479
Will my love come true?

24:31.480 --> 24:35.749
What's the color of my brimming love?

24:35.750 --> 24:39.909
Should I show a little bit of it?

24:39.910 --> 24:43.969
Just a little moment of excitement.

24:43.970 --> 24:48.039
You can see a little color coming through.

24:48.040 --> 24:52.309
My little world is shaken.

24:52.310 --> 24:56.309
But it's being gently calmed down.

24:56.310 --> 25:00.579
Your colors are too mischievous.

25:00.580 --> 25:04.519
They are spinning crazily inside me.

25:04.520 --> 25:08.579
Your colors are twisting and turning.

25:08.580 --> 25:12.429
Now they're flying past
like a shaken soda bottle.

25:12.430 --> 25:16.789
I love your colors, I
wonder if you're feeling me?

25:16.790 --> 25:20.949
Staying in your love, your
sweet and sparkly love.

25:20.950 --> 25:25.019
Your colors are twisting and turning.

25:25.020 --> 25:28.689
Will the soft strawberry
milk soar high in the air?

25:28.690 --> 25:33.019
I love your colors, I wonder
what they're drawing?

25:33.020 --> 25:37.310
Staying in your love, your
sweet and sparkly love.
